---
id: deploy-help
title: deploy
---

deploy a ```sh nuts```

##) SYNOPSIS:

    ```sh nuts deploy [<-options>]... <file-or-id>...```
        deploy a file or artifact ID to a repository

##) OPTIONS:

    ```sh -d | --desc <desc-file>```
        descriptor file path

    ```sh -s | --source | --from <repository>```
        source repository to deploy from

    ```sh -r | --target | --to <repository>```
        target repository to deploy to

    ```sh --sha1 <hash>```
        SHA-1 checksum for the artifact content

    ```sh --desc-sha1 <hash>```
        SHA-1 checksum for the descriptor file

```!include classpath:/net/thevpc/nuts/runtime/includes/standard-command.ntf```

##) EXAMPLES:

    ```sh nuts deploy myjar.jar```
        deploy myjar.jar file to default local repository

    ```sh nuts deploy example:some-thing --to system```
        deploy example:some-thing to system repository
